_ohc=n0zh_bB2L34Q7kNvwGHKFrt&_nc_oc=AdqI39ncF215ce2GqfcQhNSSKpf5zMY3EbGDdF9OsN24STEdcgnBsTPRhzWtmSL_OCU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ2dzNT3IHONsZZh_tKv9wm44DIcgfd78ClmkNfhZuRpA&oe=6AEE03AF"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57162.png", "id": "2087193361730451", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462203_2087193365063784_862658085619166334_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4qrqnrYuKwkQ7kNvwGDT3kd&_nc_oc=AdrtFb6bVigGxDaZV4tiiJgrvUy_f3PkT28Ta7c7p13eRHQCtftKXCGS3bujdSbMe8c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlxayd6hEl3oyc2ofD0-IgTvGOf2zxT4EZtwfnF5iB3Q&oe=6AEDE7A7"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57163.png", "id": "565742826430110", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031337_565742829763443_2348743012161439434_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tQBR0yXb_p8Q7kNvwHmreZM&_nc_oc=Ado1coxXu0qJyYyPR5AVoRcD2n41s8YZGCM_GcOJxGoc7J67YQIYWt8osjZ0MW0XXtk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTLtH16SRwfcJPumoTkh29K094VpBXj3Dky0wIreYdxgA&oe=6AEDFF11"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57164.png", "id": "457325230760902", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485575_457325234094235_6559372112880837045_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FWI7_oKNLx4Q7kNvwEm-3Tk&_nc_oc=AdrSolC6Fcn9cthCV7Vhma4OLZ3nDyKlHk7yGflsp8BI1KFQWCMywQxcFiS_DEWGuJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSx5NOLu8wsgg7kvl6nTZ1I6VBLj9wp26Zo5NLn1J-D2A&oe=6AEDE967"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57165.png", "id": "2043351619496913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031437_2043351622830246_8775906402630274259_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wo8GYOOeuxYQ7kNvwGDe34Q&_nc_oc=Adp6sLaPrrwwGoL1Zrer7OD4XI679RSU2WYkiBchEjJmQ7qCTOxXOsPkAIscAop9kaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQrvXHzpe7rzck-jabqaLiVlfm80meFM5EXtqbDHVqQmA&oe=6AEDD847"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ExitToilet", "keywords": ["escape", "puzzles", "inference"], "long_description": "Game Description\nThe CEO of a biotech company mysteriously vanishes one morning. As a determined journalist, you sneak into his mansion to investigate, only to find yourself trapped in a creepy bathroom. Each clue and puzzle brings you closer to uncovering the truth\u2014but the deeper you go, the darker the secrets become.\n\nThis escape room is a test of wit, courage, and observation. Solve puzzles, uncover a sinister conspiracy, and escape before time runs out.\n\nGame Features\nGripping Narrative: A story full of twists and hidden secrets.\nImmersive Environment: Tense atmosphere with detailed designs and sound.\nChallenging Puzzles: Solve intricate puzzles with keen observation.\nPsychological Tension: Every revelation brings more danger.\nComplete VR Experience: Intense first-person perspective.\n\nGameplay\nExplore and Observe: Examine the environment for clues.\nSolve Puzzles: Unlock barriers and piece together the mystery.\nUncover the Truth: Discover the secrets behind the CEO\u2019s disappearance.\nSurvive and Escape: Stay calm and find the way out.\n\nIdeal Players\nFans of mystery and puzzles.\nThrill-seekers looking for a chilling experience.\nThose who enjoy story-driven gameplay.\nReady to face your fears and uncover the truth? The challenge awaits!\n\nControls\nHold the A button to move.\nPress the grab button to interact with objects.", "short_description": "The CEO of a biotech giant vanishes mysteriously during his commute, shocking the world. As a journalist, you sneak into his mansion for answers but become trapped in a chilling bathroom full of secrets.\n\nThis isn\u2019t just an escape room\u2014it\u2019s a test of wit and courage. Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and reveal the dark truth behind the CEO\u2019s disappearance. Face your fears, escape, and expose a conspiracy that will shake the world.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "LOGO.png", "id": "2597103487166681", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86625129_2597103490500014_3922643013080904156_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z3Ggr4FLV-gQ7kNvwEtb2MZ&_nc_oc=AdqBoHX7tBCcbMlLSHzojHVVgyesknmeLAcNKP-sEZg0tgAoj4Us6m8cmFG9BLavvp4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ4bII-dVrtVBqstxWMWFJW7oPajZjH5HKKiFu2t9oJqw&oe=6AEDE644"}, {"file_name": "1008x1440.png", "id": "1182949610072593", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75392232_1182949613405926_2898506178213785049_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QRxfQ0smvIUQ7kNvwGrp5Gw&_nc_oc=AdqaKWbDk7zakLoUYXGwZLqMACl74tVV7mRGFp9ndCL_i6fGp4N4t9v0SdOwecssTg0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTY4r5j4jNskDl3KzxkWmyMWomYEYQXULPx8OMhLmycRA&oe=6AEDF436"}, {"file_name": "1080x360.png", "id": "1144873710614671", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031548_1144873713948004_7837426084537891215_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kGh6t9H1SPAQ7kNvwGwXQ4E&_nc_oc=AdpgOQBjM-C5Xz4wTaAC457lKK1D6hQ7F9Y7lCxYmmWsZZlQ9ooluWD0Ck5wy5r24mY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTRFJA0lut06IAKbTkTfCcmRd-8VRepBp0qNskenuvlfg&oe=6AEDF78D"}, {"file_name": "LOGO.png", "id": "1133433471817081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375772_1133433475150414_1715205268410684577_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-WRD_KK3BBgQ7kNvwGNQT-n&_nc_oc=AdqAhEm-KP7NUFjoi2ppyKYb4DoSyMaGY_56FuxVW1EZxmoBQfbzLjO_v5jK-ZYjeME&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTbZJr2u9XMMveFr_UzlUo7G4a9fAk4stezimqDR87DYg&oe=6AEDFC41"}, {"file_name": "3000x900.png", "id": "930390195865438", "image_type": "APP_I